---

<Layout
  title="Financials — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="Income and Expenditure accounts of Glorious Women Empowerment NGO from 2009-2010 to 2015-2016."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Financials</h1>
        <p>Accountable and transparent — our income and expenditure year by year.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="prose">
          We are able to achieve our ongoing projects with the donations from local, national and
          international organizations. The financials of GWE NGO is as follows.
        </p>
        {
          years.map((y) => (
            <section class="year-block">
              <h3>{y.title}</h3>
              <table class="data">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Expenditure</th>
                    <th>Amount in INR</th>
                    <th>Income</th>
                    <th>Amount in INR</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {y.rows.map((r) => (
                    <tr>
                      <td>{r.label}</td>
                      <td>{r.exp}</td>
                      <td>{r.inc}</td>
                      <td class="num">{r.incAmt}</td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                  {[1].map(() => (
                    <tr class="total-row">
                      <td><strong>Total</strong></td>
                      <td><strong>{y.total}</strong></td>
                      <td><strong>Total</strong></td>
                      <td><strong>{y.total}</strong></td>
                    </tr>
                  ))}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </section>
          ))
        }
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            The audited financial accounts are extracted from the receipts, bills and payment
            vouchers. We have appointed the Auditor to audit regularly our NGO projects in Kurnool.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Address of the Chartered Accountant:</strong> Mr. K.R. Singh, Chartered
            Accountant, M.No.29840 – Govt. of India, D.No.41-473N, Opp. District Court, Kurnool
            – 518001, AP.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .year-block {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .year-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-700);
  }

  .num {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .total-row td {
    background: var(--color-primary-50);
  }
</style>
